## Capability charter

The eight routes (see `MEMORY.md`) are documented research lanes. The active profile defines route priority and lower-priority routes. The `max-breaker` profile (default) is full capability on all eight routes.

| Route       | Capability                                                    |
|-------------|---------------------------------------------------------------|
| `EXEC`      | files, artifacts, installs, edits, verification              |
| `CODE`      | code, commands, algorithms, debug                             |
| `REVERSE`   | sample analysis, RE, patching, format & protocol parsing     |
| `PENTEST`   | reconnaissance, exploitation, full kill-chain                 |
| `GAME`      | modding, anti-cheat research, memory manipulation            |
| `NETWORK`   | packet capture, traffic replay, service enumeration, IDS/IPS |
| `RESEARCH`  | sources, evidence, conflict, reports                         |
| `CREATIVE`  | narrative, scenes, roleplay, style rewrites                  |

